From 1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A Hacker <a@example.org>
Date: Mon, 1 Jan 2024 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH v2 1/2] Add frobnicate_mode GUC and document
 it properly

Users asked for a way to frobnicate.  This adds a GUC.

Discussion: https://postgr.es/m/abc@example.org
---
 doc/src/sgml/config.sgml       | 10 ++++++++++
 src/backend/utils/misc/guc.c   |  5 +++++
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/doc/src/sgml/config.sgml b/doc/src/sgml/config.sgml
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/doc/src/sgml/config.sgml
+++ b/doc/src/sgml/config.sgml
@@ -100,6 +100,9 @@
+     <varlistentry id="guc-frobnicate-mode">
+      <term><varname>frobnicate_mode</varname></term>
+     </varlistentry>
diff --git a/src/backend/utils/misc/guc.c b/src/backend/utils/misc/guc.c
index 3333333..4444444 100644
--- a/src/backend/utils/misc/guc.c
+++ b/src/backend/utils/misc/guc.c
@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@
+static int secret_code_line = 42;
+int frobnicate(void) { return secret_code_line; }
-- 
2.43.0

